#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:5 ce30148f075045df8ad0a31ba6037345
msgid "QSTABILIZE Mode"
msgstr "QSTABILIZE 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:7 14cb9a56e03b487fa864d3628c256d71
msgid ""
"QSTABILIZE mode allows you to fly your vehicle manually, but self-levels the"
" roll and pitch axis."
msgstr "QSTABILIZE 模式允许您手动飞行飞行器，但会自动保持横滚和俯仰轴水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:12 2827b57b55954a31b67ec27bd2b0c333
msgid ""
"If you're learning to fly, try :ref:`QHOVER <qhover-mode>` or :ref:`QLOITER "
"<qloiter-mode>` instead of QSTABILIZE. You'll have fewer crashes if you "
"don't need to concentrate on too many controls at once."
msgstr ""
"如果您正在学习飞行，建议尝试 :ref:`QHOVER <qhover-mode>` 或 :ref:`QLOITER <qloiter-"
"mode>`，而非 QSTABILIZE。减少同时需要控制的操作数量可降低坠机风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:20 b6e9d8a1c00e4a8a9dbdf711f668fce4
msgid ""
"While QSTABILIZE mode does not necessarily require GPS, switching to QRTL or"
" RTL in case of emergency does. Make sure you do have a reliable position "
"estimate prior to arming, most commonly provided by 3D GPS fix with "
"sufficient HDOP. This is required by default in the arming checks. It is "
"highly recommended that these checks not be  disabled."
msgstr ""
"QSTABILIZE 模式本身不一定需要 GPS，但在紧急情况下切换到 QRTL 或 RTL "
"模式则需要。请确保在解锁前已获得可靠的位置估计，通常由具有足够 HDOP 的3D GPS "
"定位提供。这在默认解锁检查中是必要条件，强烈建议不要禁用这些检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:25 fcc8da2523ba433bac79b35ac76c28b8
msgid ""
"Flying QuadPlane backwards at speed or backwards into high wind is not "
"recommended, since the Plane control surfaces will act backwards and could "
"increase instability."
msgstr "不建议以高速向后飞行 QuadPlane 或在强顶风中向后飞，因为飞机的控制面将反向作用，可能增加不稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:29 f039c4da6fb84a1c906b4c583508501f
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:31 e6893d723f09418d8c1c33a126210717
msgid ""
"Pilot's roll and pitch input control the lean angle of the QuadPlane. When "
"the pilot releases the roll and pitch sticks the vehicle automatically "
"levels itself."
msgstr "飞手的横滚和俯仰输入控制 QuadPlane 的倾斜角。当飞手松开横滚和俯仰摇杆时，飞行器会自动回到水平状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:34 66bb8429eb7142f1a90f6233c90dfc3a
msgid ""
"Pilot will need to regularly input roll and pitch commands to keep the "
"vehicle in place as it is pushed around by the wind."
msgstr "由于飞行器会被风吹偏，飞手需要定期输入横滚和俯仰指令以保持飞行器位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:36 1e84afce5c27435db97aecc7ca2b0b9d
msgid ""
"Pilot's yaw input controls the rate of change of the heading.  When the "
"pilot releases the yaw stick the vehicle will maintain its current heading."
msgstr "飞手的偏航输入控制航向的变化速率。当飞手松开偏航摇杆时，飞行器将保持当前航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:39 d070045b5a2348a394abe80a0a8f1277
msgid ""
"Pilot's throttle input controls the average motor speed meaning that "
"constant adjustment of the throttle is required to maintain altitude.  If "
"the pilot puts the throttle completely down the motors will go to their "
"minimum rate (Q_M_SPIN_ARMED) and if the vehicle is flying it will lose "
"attitude control and tumble."
msgstr ""
"飞手的油门输入控制平均电机转速，这意味着需要持续调整油门以维持高度。若飞手将油门完全推到底，电机将降至最低转速（Q_M_SPIN_ARMED），若飞行器正在飞行，将失去姿态控制并翻转。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:44 1c36b18b920246ce89171fcef981ee03
msgid ""
"The throttle sent to the motors is automatically adjusted based on the tilt "
"angle of the vehicle (i.e. increased as the vehicle tilts over more) to "
"reduce the compensation the pilot must do as the vehicle's attitude changes."
msgstr "发送给电机的油门根据飞行器倾斜角度自动调整（即飞行器倾斜越大，油门越高），以减少飞手在飞行器姿态改变时需要进行的补偿操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:51 6a7a26f319d746a1ba20fbc58d5ce98f
msgid ""
"Always switch into a manual mode such as QSTABILIZE if the autopilot fails "
"to control the vehicle. Maintaining control of your copter is your "
"responsibility."
msgstr "若飞控无法控制飞行器，请始终切换到 QSTABILIZE 等手动模式。维持对飞行器的控制是您的责任。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:58 137a0e896e034e33928dd309290792eb
msgid "Common Problems"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:60 010efb12c35f455d8f499f567301c67f
msgid ""
"QuadPlane flips immediately upon take-off.  This is usually caused by the "
"motor order being incorrect or spinning in the wrong direction or using an "
"incorrect propeller (clockwise vs counter-clockwise). Check the rc "
"connections for your autopilot."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 起飞后立即翻转。这通常是由电机顺序错误、旋转方向错误或使用了错误的螺旋桨（顺时针与逆时针）引起的。请检查飞控的 RC 接线。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:64 0113413158804f48ac4a6d055eb6c989
msgid ""
"QuadPlane wobbles on roll or pitch axis.  This usually means the Rate P "
"values are incorrect.  See Copter Tuning section for some hints as to how to"
" adjust the Q_A_xxx parameters."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 在横滚或俯仰轴上出现抖动。这通常意味着 Rate P 值不正确。有关如何调整 Q_A_xxx 参数的提示，请参阅 Copter "
"调参部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:67 986b55f4eb364ac8a05b8780a054503c
msgid ""
"QuadPlane wobbles when descending quickly.  This is caused by the copter "
"falling through its own prop wash and is nearly impossible to  tune out "
"although raising the Rate Roll/Pitch P values may help."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 在快速下降时出现抖动。这是因为飞行器穿过自身的螺旋桨气流引起的，几乎无法通过调参消除，但提高 Rate Roll/Pitch P "
"值可能有所帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:70 20aa19fb0fb648bead60002d8476aeb0
msgid ""
"QuadPlane yaws right or left 15degrees on take-off.  Some motors may not be "
"straight or the escs need calibration :ref:`QuadPlane ESC Calibration "
"<QuadPlane-esc-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 起飞时向左或向右偏航15度。部分电机可能未对准，或 ESC 需要校准，请参阅 :ref:`QuadPlane ESC 校准 "
"<QuadPlane-esc-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:72 6846e697c18544ee8eb654788ec7d9db
msgid ""
"QuadPlane does not maintain altitude or does not stay perfectly still in the"
" air.  As mentioned above this is a manual flight mode and requires constant"
" control of the sticks to maintain altitude and position."
msgstr "QuadPlane 无法保持高度或在空中保持静止。如上所述，这是手动飞行模式，需要持续控制摇杆以维持高度和位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:76 6d2aa2eb609c4176adb61fbb69705cdb
msgid ""
"occasional twitches in roll or pitch.  Normally caused by some kind of "
"interference on the receiver (for example FPV equipment placed too close to "
"the receiver) or by ESC problems that may be resolved by :ref:`QuadPlane ESC"
" Calibration <quadplane-esc-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"横滚或俯仰偶发性抖动。通常由接收机受到某种干扰（例如 FPV 设备放置在接收机太近处）或 ESC 问题引起，ESC 问题可通过 "
":ref:`QuadPlane ESC 校准 <quadplane-esc-calibration>` 解决。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:80 10fe34f7c6df4fea8438c94eceea50eb
msgid ""
"sudden flips during flight.  This is nearly always caused by "
":ref:`mechanical failures <copter:common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_mechanical_failures>` of the motor or ESCs."
msgstr ""
"飞行中突然翻转。这几乎总是由电机或 ESC 的 :ref:`机械故障 <copter:common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_mechanical_failures>` 引起的。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:85 5303b8be00e9438ba9576f0a7100703f
msgid "Hover Throttle"
msgstr "悬停油门"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:87 bccf60f069314684a7263bb74a7a772a
msgid ""
"Usually, it is desired to hover in any mode at mid-stick on throttle, so "
"that transitions between modes is easily accomplished without throttle "
"position changes. This can be adjusted using the "
":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` parameter, or automatically learned in"
" QHOVER or QLOITER modes by enabling "
":ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN<Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>`."
msgstr ""
"通常希望在任意模式下都能在油门中位悬停，以便模式切换时无需调整油门位置。可通过 "
":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` 参数手动调整，或通过启用 "
":ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN<Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>` 在 QHOVER 或 QLOITER 模式中自动学习。"

#: ../../source/docs/qstabilize-mode.rst:89 711ac76f91a941fd849c5b51bc08ac68
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_THROTTLE_EXPO<Q_THROTTLE_EXPO>` = 0 in QACRO and QSTABILIZE "
"modes, then :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>`, whether set manually or "
"learned via :ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN<Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>`, is not applied, and the"
" throttle is determined directly from the RC input."
msgstr ""
"在 QACRO 和 QSTABILIZE 模式下，若 :ref:`Q_THROTTLE_EXPO<Q_THROTTLE_EXPO>` = "
"0，则无论是手动设置还是通过 :ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN<Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>` 学习的 "
":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` 均不会生效，油门将直接由 RC 输入决定。"
